+section('about-us') 
    .row.align-items-center
        .col-12.col-lg-6.flex-auto.read-more-wrapper
            +title('mb-4','Shaping Qatar’s Business Landscape')  

            p.sub-title.fw-normal.fs-20.read-more-content.collapsed The Qatar Financial Centre (QFC) is a leading onshore business and financial platform, enabling firms to operate seamlessly within Qatar’s dynamic market. Offering a unique combination of flexibility, international standards and strategic access, QFC empowers businesses to scale, innovate and thrive in one of the region’s most stable economies.Established under Law No. 7 of 2005 by the State of Qatar, QFC is a core pillar of Qatar’s diversification agenda under Qatar National Vision 2030. It provides a robust legal, regulatory, tax and business environment for both financial and non-financial firms to set up businesses in Qatar.The Qatar Financial Centre (QFC) is a leading onshore business and financial platform, enabling firms to operate seamlessly within Qatar’s dynamic market. Offering a unique combination of flexibility, international standards and strategic access, QFC empowers businesses to scale, innovate and thrive in one of the region’s most stable economies.Established under Law No. 7 of 2005 by the State of Qatar, QFC is a core pillar of Qatar’s diversification agenda under Qatar National Vision 2030. It provides a robust legal, regulatory, tax and business environment for both financial and non-financial firms to set up businesses in Qatar.
            
